{"4906630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cats Out", "steam_appid": 4906630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>the Situation.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats think they can steal anything just because they are cute. They are everywhere, stealing anything they can get their paws on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>the aim.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't fall for their cuteness. Make a stand and don't let them steal. Shoo them away. Recover everything they've stolen. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>the weapons.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The almighty broom and slippers are your sacred weapons. Swing your broom, Throw your slippers to shoo those pesky cats running. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>the team power.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing them alone is brave. But they can be too much. So, Call your friends, summon your team. Together, beat those hungry cute little thieves back to wherever they came from!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>the Situation.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats think they can steal anything just because they are cute. They are everywhere, stealing anything they can get their paws on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>the aim.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't fall for their cuteness. Make a stand and don't let them steal. Shoo them away. Recover everything they've stolen. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>the weapons.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The almighty broom and slippers are your sacred weapons. Swing your broom, Throw your slippers to shoo those pesky cats running. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>the team power.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing them alone is brave. But they can be too much. So, Call your friends, summon your team. Together, beat those hungry cute little thieves back to wherever they came from!</p>"